            </note>
            <note corresp="#d397-f2" n="2" xml:id="d397-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d161">Document 161</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d397-f3" n="3" xml:id="d397-f3-content">
                <p>The minutes of the December 28 SCC meeting were not found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d397-f4" n="4" xml:id="d397-f4-content">
                <p>The minutes of the NSC meeting are printed in <ref target="frus1977-80v12#d107"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, vol. XII,
                        Afghanistan, Document 107</ref>. The decision to send Christopher to
                    Pakistan was affirmed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
